---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="card card--tint">
  <div class="icon-wrap" style="background:#fff"><Icon name="key" /></div>
  <h3>Already moved out or interstate? No need to be there.</h3>
  <ul class="ticks">
    <li>Leave keys in a lockbox, with the agent, or we collect them.</li>
    <li>We deal with your agent about access if you've already gone.</li>
    <li>Room-by-room photos and the tax invoice land in your inbox the same day.</li>
    <li>If the agent sends a list, we handle the re-clean without you flying back.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
